# Copy to sandbox-image/build.env (gitignored) on each build host, or point
# SANDBOX_BUILD_ENV at a file elsewhere. Everything here is deployment-specific;
# build-rootfs.sh's defaults are upstream-canonical, so no file at all builds a
# correct image that simply fetches from upstream and resolves via public DNS.

# --- package mirrors -------------------------------------------------------
# Ubuntu. Unset picks archive.ubuntu.com on amd64/i386 and ports.ubuntu.com
# elsewhere (arm64 hosts are only served by ports).
#UBUNTU_MIRROR=https://mirror.example.com/ubuntu
#UBUNTU_MIRROR=https://mirror.example.com/ubuntu-ports

# pip. Unset means pypi.org. --trusted-host is only needed for a plain-http index.
#PIP_INDEX_URL=https://mirror.example.com/repository/pypi/simple
#PIP_TRUSTED_HOST=mirror.example.com

# npm, used for the Pi driver inside the chroot. Unset means registry.npmjs.org.
# This does NOT affect frontend/package-lock.json, whose `resolved` URLs stay
# canonical on purpose — configure the frontend build's mirror in the host's
# ~/.npmrc instead. See scripts/check-lockfile-registry.sh.
#NPM_REGISTRY=https://mirror.example.com/repository/npm/

# Node tarballs. Unset means https://nodejs.org/dist.
#NODE_DIST_BASE_URL=https://mirror.example.com/nodejs

# --- DNS baked into the image ---------------------------------------------
# Resolvers written to the image's /etc/resolv.conf. The sandbox falls back to
# these whenever the orchestrator is not projecting per-generation hosts, so they
# must be reachable from wherever the image runs. Unset means 1.1.1.1 + 8.8.8.8.
# Example local override; use the resolver appropriate to the target network.
#SANDBOX_DNS_SERVERS="192.0.2.53"
#SANDBOX_DNS_SEARCH=example.test

# --- build-host network quirks -------------------------------------------
# Executable run after debootstrap with the rootfs dir as $1, to make the chroot
# able to fetch at all. Leave unset on a host with working DNS. dev/build-dns-pin.sh
# handles a fake-ip proxy (clash and similar) that answers every query with an
# unroutable 198.18.0.0/15 address.
#SANDBOX_BUILD_DNS_HOOK=/path/to/repo/dev/build-dns-pin.sh
